# PLATFORM FEATURE FLAGS — admin-controlled lock/unlock for
# regulated or otherwise sensitive features (parametric insurance,
# diaspora investment, and any existing feature the admin wants to
# pull back, e.g. the carbon credit marketplace). Fail-safe CLOSED:
# _feature_enabled() returns False for any flag that has never been
# explicitly turned on by an admin -- a newly-added regulated feature
# is never silently live just because nobody visited the toggle
# screen yet. See requires_feature_flag() and the /admin/feature-flags
# routes further down.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

