    #     interbank exchange rates, inflation figures, and Mosi-oa-Tunya
    #     gold coin prices, scraped from the Reserve Bank of Zimbabwe's
    #     own site multiple times a day. Free signup at
    #     zimrate.statotec.com/signup, keys are prefixed "zr_". The same
