    #     (afrirate.statotec.com), which covers exchange rates for 28
    #     African countries beyond Zimbabwe under the same key — used
    #     here for the "other countries" region toggle on the rates tab.
    #     Docs confirmed live at zimrate.statotec.com/docs before
    #     building; pasted field: api_key.
    #   - opentripmap: OpenTripMap (opentripmap.com) — worldwide points
    #     of interest (tourist attractions, museums, cultural/natural
    #     sites, and accommodation/hospitality venues via its
    #     "accomodations" kind), free API key on signup. Pasted field:
