# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# STAGE 94: SUCCESSION & BUSINESS CONTINUITY PLANNING
# Family businesses in this region collapse constantly when a founder
# dies or steps back with no documented plan. This is deliberately NOT
# just a document generator — it's a living checklist paired with a
# real-time snapshot pulled straight from the ERP data already on this
# platform (employees, customers, receivables, payables, inventory
# value), so the plan never goes stale the way a one-off PDF would.
# The checklist items themselves (legal documents, successor briefing,
# bank signatory arrangements) are things only a human can truthfully
# mark done — this tool never claims to auto-verify them.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

