# STAGE — LOAN & GRANT FINDER: SESSION HISTORY + FINANCIAL ADVISOR
# HITL REVIEW & SEAL
#
# /api/grants/find (above) now persists each search as a
# GrantFinderSession. Same register-your-own-professional /
# send-for-review / tokenized-link / seal-or-reject pattern as the
# Stress Score block above, here with a financial advisor, loan
# officer, grant officer, or accountant the user names themselves.
#
# HONESTY NOTE: RegisteredFinancialAdvisor fields are self-attested —
# Connect It does not verify any credential (CFA, accounting body
# membership, lender accreditation, etc.) against a registry. This tool
# is general funding information, not financial or legal advice — the
# user should still verify eligibility and terms directly with each
# funder before applying or signing anything.
