# Two more AcademicLookupQuery subjects, both fully public with no key:
#
#   geography — REST Countries (https://restcountries.com), the
#   long-standing free, public, no-key country reference API: capitals,
#   population, area, currencies, languages, timezones, region/subregion.
#
#   history — history.muffinlabs.com's real "on this day" API, sourced
#   from Wikipedia: events, births, and deaths for any given month/day.
