# The GratitudeEntry model and _db_add_gratitude() helper already
# existed (used by the WhatsApp/Telegram/Messenger bot integrations)
# but had no REST endpoint for the web app — which is why the web
# Gallery panel was, until now, writing to localStorage only and never
# actually shared anyone's posts. This closes that gap.
