# average freight), used only when a seller hasn't declared their own
# figure on a listing. Deliberately coarse — a small, defensible set of
# buckets rather than a false-precision per-SKU table — sourced from
# published retail-sector LCA ranges (apparel ~10-25kg/item, small
# electronics ~40-80kg/unit, packaged food ~1-3kg/kg, etc.), taking the
