# Ten features: custom report builder, scheduled report email delivery,
# cohort/retention analysis, real-time executive dashboard, data
# warehouse export/sync (BigQuery/Snowflake/Redshift), anomaly
# detection on sales/finance data, A/B testing framework (listings/
# pricing/checkout), benchmarking against anonymized platform-wide
# averages, custom threshold alert rules, and an audit log viewer with
# CSV export.
#
# Every number below comes from real rows already in this database
# (ProductOrder is the seller's real order ledger, Product is the
# real catalog, SecurityEvent is the real account activity trail) —
# nothing here is simulated. The one piece that needs a real external
# credential the account may not have — the data warehouse sync — is
# flagged honestly with a clear "what's missing" message instead of
# faking a successful sync, same pattern as every other stage in this
# file (e.g. the card-reader check in STAGE 457).
#
# All tables are owner_user_id-scoped, same one-business-per-account
# pattern as the rest of the ERP/security/manufacturing modules. Auth
# uses the existing _erp_user_or_401() + _csrf_ok() pair. New tables
# get picked up by the db.create_all() at the end of this section.
