# NotebookLM-parity additions: Mind Map, Study Guide/Flashcards,
# and Audio Overview. All three follow the exact same shape as
# notebook_generate_overview above — generate-on-demand (never
# automatic, never silently stale), cached in their own table,
# strictly grounded in _notebook_combined_source_text (real source
# text only, same budget-sharing approach), and the frontend shows
# how many sources a cached result was generated from vs. the
# current count so staleness is visible rather than silent.
